    "detailed_description": "<h1>JOIN OUR DISCORD</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598630/extras/ee172f7afcfe242cc1e71d7a77e1bf07.avif?t=1746876017\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Collect and hatch eggs. Delegate dragons on epic expeditions on which they will fight an auto battle for loot and goodies. Build your dragons with diverse evolutions, perks, amulets, and more! <br>Complete quests to unlock new features. Participate in 3 vs 3 battles during dungeons, designed with roguelite mode in mind, for the best loot possible. Increase the number of dragons to optimize your income and progress. Take your time to max out amulets in the blacksmith, manage funds carefully to avoid inflation, collect all the collectables to fulfill your gallery.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WATCH YOUR DRAGONS FIGHT ON YOUR COMMAND</strong></h2>Your dragons will battle on variety of adventures and dungeons. Train and upgrade them for the toughest challenges!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598630/extras/2bb6fece68cb20b1a8c78cb8ee861b2d.poster.avif?t=1746876017\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598630/extras/2bb6fece68cb20b1a8c78cb8ee861b2d.webm?t=1746876017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598630/extras/2bb6fece68cb20b1a8c78cb8ee861b2d.mp4?t=1746876017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COLLECT AND EQUIP AMULETS</strong></h2>Choose from over 50 amulets to create a unique path for your dragon. Take the highest quality ones to become a real raid boss.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598630/extras/74e3e8932848e47962a140b8ba4c92d3.avif?t=1746876017\" width=800 height=600 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HATCH AND UPGRADE</strong></h2>Discover 30+ dragons, with some evolving into 26 unique forms and upgrade their TIER to unlock new dragon upgrades!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598630/extras/815f42f33e3d6cfc56a91bfd69d9618f.avif?t=1746876017\" data-has-big width=800 height=668 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHOSE YOUR PLAYSTYLE</strong></h2>Each dragon has a unique perk tree to suit various playstyles and counterplay enemies. Discover over 100 unique effects!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598630/extras/0465edc0f09a6892ca1d82f039cdccb3.avif?t=1746876017\" width=600 height=200 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598630/extras/4a061ff53fa659f05d19fef5a375b62c.avif?t=1746876017\" width=600 height=200 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598630/extras/07f8688f3c9de796a3c8d7acff916bdd.avif?t=1746876017\" width=600 height=200 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DUNGEONS &amp; DRAGONS</strong></h2>Dungeons is a key feature in the game which builds up whole progress and adds roguelite element to the game. Progress through dungeon and defeat enemies to draft your special dungeon abilities and collect passive bonuses. Each dungeon in the game has its main unique boss and some unique features, be aware!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598630/extras/87fdac083451c339754c85741f32be59.avif?t=1746876017\" width=600 height=392 /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "Collect and hatch eggs. Delegate dragons on epic expeditions on which they will fight an auto battle for loot and goodies. Build your dragons with diverse evolutions, perks, amulets, and more! <br>Complete quests to unlock new features. Participate in 3 vs 3 battles during dungeons, designed with roguelite mode in mind, for the best loot possible. Increase the number of dragons to optimize your income and progress. Take your time to max out amulets in the blacksmith, manage funds carefully to avoid inflation, collect all the collectables to fulfill your gallery.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WATCH YOUR DRAGONS FIGHT ON YOUR COMMAND</strong></h2>Your dragons will battle on variety of adventures and dungeons. Train and upgrade them for the toughest challenges!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598630/extras/2bb6fece68cb20b1a8c78cb8ee861b2d.poster.avif?t=1746876017\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598630/extras/2bb6fece68cb20b1a8c78cb8ee861b2d.webm?t=1746876017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598630/extras/2bb6fece68cb20b1a8c78cb8ee861b2d.mp4?t=1746876017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COLLECT AND EQUIP AMULETS</strong></h2>Choose from over 50 amulets to create a unique path for your dragon. Take the highest quality ones to become a real raid boss.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598630/extras/74e3e8932848e47962a140b8ba4c92d3.avif?t=1746876017\" width=800 height=600 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HATCH AND UPGRADE</strong></h2>Discover 30+ dragons, with some evolving into 26 unique forms and upgrade their TIER to unlock new dragon upgrades!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598630/extras/815f42f33e3d6cfc56a91bfd69d9618f.avif?t=1746876017\" data-has-big width=800 height=668 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHOSE YOUR PLAYSTYLE</strong></h2>Each dragon has a unique perk tree to suit various playstyles and counterplay enemies. Discover over 100 unique effects!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598630/extras/0465edc0f09a6892ca1d82f039cdccb3.avif?t=1746876017\" width=600 height=200 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598630/extras/4a061ff53fa659f05d19fef5a375b62c.avif?t=1746876017\" width=600 height=200 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598630/extras/07f8688f3c9de796a3c8d7acff916bdd.avif?t=1746876017\" width=600 height=200 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DUNGEONS &amp; DRAGONS</strong></h2>Dungeons is a key feature in the game which builds up whole progress and adds roguelite element to the game. Progress through dungeon and defeat enemies to draft your special dungeon abilities and collect passive bonuses. Each dungeon in the game has its main unique boss and some unique features, be aware!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598630/extras/87fdac083451c339754c85741f32be59.avif?t=1746876017\" width=600 height=392 /></span>",
    "short_description": "The Dragonhood is a clicker RPG with roguelite elements and automatic battles. Collect eggs, hatch dragons, and loot stuff on a variety of 1 vs 1 adventures or 3 vs 3 dungeons. Complete quests and build your dragons the way you want with various evolutions, abilities, amulets, and more!",
